extra comment : About BioReplicate and Condition. I found that certain BioReplicate has all conditions. For example, BioReplicate=1 has Condition1 measurement, Condition2 measurement,... Condition10 measurement. (it is like Time-course design). I'm wondering whether it is correct design of your experiment. If 4 BioReplicates in condition1 and 4 BioReplicates in Condition2 are the same matches, it is correct ("BioReplicate"  is from 1 to 4). However, if 4 BioReplicates in condition1 and 4 BioReplicates in Condition2 are different (basically, subjects in each condition are different), you should use different label for column "BioReplicate" (from 1 to 8).

Hope that it is helpful for you.

-Meena

